# Passenger Ferry: the payment is optional ("you may pay {U}"). On turn 3 Bot1 crews it with Grizzly Bears, attacks with the Ferry and Savannah Lions and does not pay: no
# reflexive ability, so no target is asked, and Bot2's Ornithopter blocks the Lions (CR 509.1b is not in play). The Lions (2/1) die to nothing - the Ornithopter is 0/2 -
# and only the Ferry's 4 connects: Bot2 is at 16.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Passenger Ferry
Savannah Lions
Grizzly Bears
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

